<slide>
<title>AST is converted to bytecode</title>

<blurb>AST:</blurb>
<example class="medium" inline="1">
1: AST_METHOD
    flags: MODIFIER_PUBLIC (256)
    name: |00dd00|__construct|
    params: AST_PARAM_LIST
        0: AST_PARAM
            name: |0000dd|"value"|
    stmts: AST_STMT_LIST
        0: |dd00dd|AST_ASSIGN|
            var: |00dddd|AST_PROP|
                expr: AST_VAR
                    name: |00dddd|"this"|
                prop: |00dddd|"property"|
            expr: AST_VAR
                name: |0000dd|"value"|
</example>

<blurb>Opcodes:</blurb>
<example class="medium" inline="1">
compiled vars:  |0000dd|!0 = $value|
line     #* E I O op                  return  operands
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   8     0  E >   EXT_NOP                     
         1        RECV                |0000dd|!0|      
  10     2        EXT_STMT                    
         3        |dd00dd|ASSIGN||00dddd|_OBJ|                  |00dddd|'property'|
         4        |dd00dd|OP_DATA|                     |0000dd|!0|
  11     5        EXT_STMT
         6      > RETURN                      null
</example>
